/images/blog/2025-12-22-technology-vocabulary-digital-1.jpg","alt":"디지털 시대 기술 영어 어휘 마스터 클래스 집중 부트캠프","fill":true,"className":"object-cover shadow-none","priority":true,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 900px"}]}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-shell py-[40px] md:py-[80px]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[900px] mx-auto","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-content prose prose-lg max-w-none","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"디지털 세상에서 영어는 더 이상 교과서 속 언어가 아닙니다. 우리가 매일 사용하는 스마트폰, 클라우드 서비스, 스트리밍 플랫폼 모두 영어를 기반으로 작동합니다."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["YES를 통해 영어 회화 실력을 다지고 있는 여러분이라면, 이제는 일상 회화를 넘어 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"'기술 영어(Tech English)'"}],"라는 새로운 장벽에 도전할 때입니다. 이 어휘들은 IT 산업 종사자뿐만 아니라, 해외 고객센터와 소통하거나, 해외 IT 기사를 읽거나, 심지어 해외 친구들과 게임이나 앱에 대해 이야기할 때도 필수적입니다."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"이번 포스트는 여러분의 기술 영어 실력을 급격히 끌어올릴 수 있는 부트캠프 스타일의 집중 학습 가이드입니다. 핵심 용어와 함께 실생활에서 바로 쓸 수 있는 구체적인 예문을 완벽하게 익혀봅시다."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"1. 네트워크 및 연결 상태 설명에 필요한 핵심 용어"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-12-22-technology-vocabulary-digital-1-h2-1.jpg","alt":"1. 네트워크 및 연결 상태 설명에 필요한 핵심 용어","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"1. 네트워크 및 연결 상태 설명에 필요한 핵심 용어"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"디지털 세계의 기본은 연결성입니다. 인터넷 연결 문제를 설명하거나, 빠르고 느림의 차이를 논할 때 막연한 단어 대신 전문적인 용어를 사용하면 훨씬 정확한 의사소통이 가능해집니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Bandwidth (대역폭)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"데이터가 이동할 수 있는 최대 용량을 의미합니다. 보통 인터넷 속도나 스트리밍 품질과 직결됩니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"If you have too many devices running simultaneously, the available ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"bandwidth"}]," will decrease.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"We need to upgrade our internet plan to get more ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"bandwidth"}]," for 4K streaming.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Latency (지연 시간)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"데이터가 한 지점에서 다른 지점으로 이동하는 데 걸리는 시간입니다. 이 수치가 높으면 실시간 화상 회의나 게임에서 끊김 현상이 발생합니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"High ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"latency"}]," is usually the reason for voice delays during video calls.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"High ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"latency"}]," is causing the video quality to drop during our YES class.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Firewall (방화벽)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"무단 액세스로부터 네트워크를 보호하는 보안 시스템입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"The company’s IT policy requires all laptops to activate the ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"firewall"}]," before connecting to the internal network.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"I think the internal ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"firewall"}]," is blocking my access to the main server.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Interface (인터페이스)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"사용자가 기기나 프로그램과 상호작용하는 방법이나 화면 자체를 뜻합니다. UI(User Interface)는 여기서 파생된 단어입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"We updated the software, but the user ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"interface"}]," is much less intuitive now.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"The new mobile app features a very clean and simple ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"interface"}],".\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"2. 소프트웨어와 서비스 이용 관련 필수 어휘"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-12-22-technology-vocabulary-digital-1-h2-2.jpg","alt":"2. 소프트웨어와 서비스 이용 관련 필수 어휘","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"2. 소프트웨어와 서비스 이용 관련 필수 어휘"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"새로운 앱을 다운로드하거나, 기능을 사용하거나, 문제가 발생했을 때 우리는 끊임없이 소프트웨어에 대한 이야기를 합니다. 개발 과정이나 사용 환경과 관련된 단어들을 숙지해야 합니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Compatibility (호환성)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"특정 하드웨어나 소프트웨어가 다른 시스템과 문제없이 함께 작동할 수 있는 능력입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"Before installing the new operating system, you must check its ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"compatibility"}]," with your old drivers.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"We found that the new graphics card has poor ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"compatibility"}]," with older motherboards.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Beta Version (베타 버전)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"정식 출시 전, 사용자들에게 공개되어 테스트와 피드백을 받는 버전입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"The developers released the ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"beta version"}]," of the game to gather feedback on the gameplay.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"I decided not to download the new feature because I prefer to wait for the stable release rather than using a ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"beta version"}],".\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Rollout (점진적 출시)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"새로운 소프트웨어나 업데이트를 모든 사용자에게 한 번에 공개하지 않고, 특정 그룹부터 점진적으로 적용하는 방식입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"The company chose a gradual ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"rollout"}]," strategy to minimize potential disruption.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"The new mobile update ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"rollout"}]," will start next week in the US and Europe.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Bug / Glitch (버그 / 글리치)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"프로그램의 오류나 결함입니다. 'Bug'는 좀 더 심각한 시스템 오류를, 'Glitch'는 일시적이고 작은 오작동을 의미합니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"A minor ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"glitch"}]," caused the website to display incorrect pricing for five minutes.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"After the recent update, I found a major ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"bug"}]," that prevents me from saving my work.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Subscription (구독)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"서비스를 계속 이용하기 위해 정기적으로 비용을 지불하는 시스템입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"Remember to check the terms and conditions before starting a free trial for a new ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"subscription"}],".\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"I need to cancel my ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"subscription"}]," before the trial period ends tomorrow.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"3. 클라우드, 데이터, 보안 관련 실전 표현"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-12-22-technology-vocabulary-digital-1-h2-3.jpg","alt":"3. 클라우드, 데이터, 보안 관련 실전 표현","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"3. 클라우드, 데이터, 보안 관련 실전 표현"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"오늘날 데이터는 하늘에 떠다닙니다. 클라우드 컴퓨팅과 개인 정보 보호는 기술 대화의 중심 주제이며, 이에 대한 용어를 정확히 아는 것은 필수입니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Cloud Storage (클라우드 저장소)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"로컬 하드 드라이브가 아닌, 인터넷을 통해 접속 가능한 원격 서버에 데이터를 저장하는 방식입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"Using ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"cloud storage"}]," allows me to access my documents from my phone or laptop anywhere.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"Make sure you back up all your photos to ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"cloud storage"}]," before wiping your device.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Encryption (암호화)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"데이터를 암호로 변환하여 승인되지 않은 접근으로부터 보호하는 과정입니다. 보안 대화에서 가장 많이 등장하는 단어 중 하나입니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"Strong ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"encryption"}]," is required to protect customer data during online transactions.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"The company uses end-to-end ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"encryption"}]," to protect user messages from third parties.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Authentication (인증)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"사용자의 신원을 확인하는 과정입니다. 흔히 'Two-Factor Authentication (2단계 인증)'으로 사용됩니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"용례:"}]," \"The login screen requires both a password and biometric ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"authentication"}],".\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"예문:"}]," \"I had trouble completing the two-factor ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"authentication"}]," because I didn't receive the text message.\""]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"childr